[I] Encode/Decode library for internationalized domain names

[T] Libidn2 is a free software implementation of IDNA2008, Punycode and
[T] Unicode TR46. Its purpose is to encode and decode internationalized
[T] domain names, and it also ships the idn2 command line tool.

[U] https://www.gnu.org/software/libidn#libidn2

